sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Notion
    participant GarminMD as GarminMD<br/>(Web App)
    participant Garmin as Garmin<br/>Connect
    participant Watch as Garmin<br/>Watch
    participant LLM as Claude<br/>(LLM)

    Note over User,LLM: PHASE 1 — PLAN

    User->>Notion: Write/update workout tables
    User->>GarminMD: Click "Sync to Garmin"
    GarminMD->>Notion: Fetch page content (OAuth)
    Notion-->>GarminMD: Markdown tables
    GarminMD->>GarminMD: Parse markdown → exercises
    GarminMD->>LLM: Resolve unknown exercise names
    LLM-->>GarminMD: Garmin exercise type IDs
    GarminMD->>GarminMD: Build workout JSON
    GarminMD->>Garmin: Push workout (createWorkout)
    Garmin-->>GarminMD: workoutId confirmed
    GarminMD-->>User: "4 workouts uploaded ✓"
    User->>Watch: Sync watch
    Garmin->>Watch: Workouts downloaded

    Note over User,LLM: PHASE 2 — TRAIN

    User->>Watch: Start workout
    Watch->>Watch: Guide exercises, count reps
    User->>Watch: Complete workout
    Watch->>Garmin: Auto-sync activity

    Note over User,LLM: PHASE 3 — REVIEW

    User->>GarminMD: Taps "Sync from Garmin"
    GarminMD->>Garmin: getActivities()
    Garmin-->>GarminMD: New activity detected
    GarminMD->>Garmin: getActivityDetails()
    Garmin-->>GarminMD: Actual sets, reps, weight, duration
    GarminMD->>GarminMD: Match activity → Notion plan
    GarminMD->>LLM: Compare plan vs actual
    LLM-->>GarminMD: Coaching insight
    GarminMD->>GarminMD: Save insight to DB
    GarminMD-->>User: Dashboard: insight + stats
